---
/**
 * /dev/home-v3/ — implementation of the approved Figma homepage.
 *
 * Local preview only. The production homepage (`/`) is untouched.
 * Figma: AIGF-EX → 10 · Homepage → "Homepage — Desktop 1440" / "Homepage — Mobile 390".
